# Ranger Landing (CIPlay ranger_landing): the station on stilts at -12 -26 (deck 4 m), the trail's three marks, the
# boat shed at -5 18 (4 m).
island Ranger Landing
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -21.5; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 21.5
expect step 0
expect title The Forgotten Shore
expect hidden track2
zone station
expect step 1
read Oda's job board
expect step 2
zone track_1
expect shown track2
zone track_2
zone track_3
expect step 3
expect hidden boatshed
open Ranger's stash
open Pilot's locker
open Ruin crate
wait 2
expect step 4
use winch
expect story winchpart 0
expect shown boatshed
expect step 5
open Ranger boat shed
wait 3
expect step 7
expect story rangerkey 1
read Ranger log 3
expect done
expect animals Chicken 3
